@startuml
title Restaurant System — Arquitectura de contenedores

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Usuario de Fratelli" as User

rectangle "Browser" as Browser {
  component "React SPA\nTypeScript + Vite + Tailwind" as Frontend
}

rectangle "Restaurant System Backend\nASP.NET Core 10" as Backend {
  component "REST API\n/api/v1" as API
  component "SignalR Kitchen Hub\n/hubs/kitchen" as Hub
  component "OpenAPI\n/openapi/v1.json" as OpenAPI
  component "Application + Domain" as Core
}

database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User --> Frontend
Frontend --> API : HTTP/HTTPS + JSON
Frontend --> Hub : WebSocket / SignalR
Frontend ..> OpenAPI : generar cliente tipado
API --> Core
Hub --> Core
Core --> DB : EF Core + Npgsql

note right of Backend
Monolito modular:
un único backend desplegable
con módulos internos separados.
end note
@enduml
